  "agent": "City Real Estate",
  "text": "Pre-completion opportunity to secure a restored Victorian at 1446 Florida Street in the heart of the Mission District. Built by Gamabuilt, one of San Francisco's premier builders, this confirmed 3bed + dedicated office, 3.5bath residence offers thoughtful level-based living: the lower level features a well-appointed primary suite with ample storage and a spacious laundry room that opens directly to the rear garden; the middle level presents a formal living room, spacious chef's kitchen, dining room and family room that open to a walk-out deck flowing into the large private garden, plus a convenient half bath; the top level contains two additional ensuite bedrooms and a dedicated office. Classic contemporary finishes include a chef's kitchen with Miele appliances and stone counters, designer bathrooms, smarthome prewiring, energyefficient systems, inunit laundry, and private outdoor space. Foundation poured and planning complete; delivered in around 12 months. Beautiful tree-lined street walkable to 24th Street shops and restaurants and steps from Precita Park. Approximately +/- 2,622 sq ft with a 1-car garage and a deep, flat garden. NOTE: This is an opportunity to pre-purchase the home, all images are renders of the future residence. Property also available for purchase as is with foundation complete.",
