  "rating": "",
  "agent": "The Canlas Brothers",
  "text": "Right in the heart of the Mission's lively 20th Street corridor, this contemporary home offers flexibility, character, and serious upside in one of San Francisco's most sought-after neighborhoods. The main level is bright and inviting, featuring a recently remodeled kitchen that opens into the living and dining areas perfect for everyday living or entertaining. You'll find stainless steel appliances, a skylight, and large windows that bring in great natural light, along with a remodeled upstairs bathroom, updated bedroom, remodeled kitchen and in-unit washer/dryer. Downstairs adds even more versatility with three additional rooms, currently used as bedrooms, but easily adaptable for a home office or family room depending on your needs. The lower level also features remodeled flooring and its own updated feel throughout. Recent upgrades include fresh interior paint, a new roof, new exit doors, and a new egress staircase giving added value and peace of mind. Step outside to a private back patio, or take advantage of the roof space with downtown views ideal for enjoying sunny Mission days. All of this just steps from some of the city's best renowned restaurants, cocktail bars, coffee shops, and iconic murals that define the neighborhood. A rare opportunity to own a single-family home in a prime location, at a price point that rivals a condo.",
